cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MemePump extension for Gemini CLI"
abstract: "MemePump is a read-only Solana token safety checker for AI assistants: it returns a token's risk score, honeypot signal, liquidity-lock status, mint and freeze authority, holder concentration and wallet clusters over MCP. It cannot trade or move funds and never asks for a wallet key. Output is informational, not financial advice."
authors:
  - name: "MemePump"
    website: "https://memepump.org"
repository-code: "https://github.com/airdropfi/memepump-gemini-extension"
url: "https://memepump.org/mcp"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
keywords:
  - mcp
  - model-context-protocol
  - mcp-server
  - solana
  - token-safety
  - rug-pull
  - honeypot
  - gemini-cli
